    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, u said \"low circulating levels of aldosterone signal the adrenal glands to reduce estrogen synthesis\"?? i didnt realize that was part of it. can u explain that part again? how does preventing angiotensin ii lead to that specific chain reaction with aldosterone and estrogen?",
